    "created_at": "2017-10-29T08:06:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-10-29T08:06:01Z",
    "body": "I think concern 1 is invalid since script could modify Event.prototype.type as well. Concern 2 seems somewhat reasonable (although it not being clearly defined that there's a \"platform internal\" slot of sorts seems like a bug).\r\n\r\nWonder what @smaug---- thinks.",
