    "created_at": "2017-10-29T10:48:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-10-29T10:48:25Z",
    "body": "I think I've seen events to be reused for different types, though could have been some Firefox only code.\r\nAnd reuse isn't totally crazy idea in some games for example where one might want to avoid garbage as much as possible.\r\nBut I don't have really strong opinion on this.",
