    "body": "I don't have any strong opinion on this.\r\n\r\nI've seen several tests (WPT and layout tests in Blink) which re-use an event object in initEvent, however, I don't see any production code which re-uses an event object.\r\n\r\n> I know we’d have to do some research about web compatibility\r\n\r\nYup, we have to do. ",
